{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01050","headline":"相和歌辞 江南曲 · 罗隐","name":"相和歌辞 江南曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江烟湿雨鲛绡輭，漠漠远山眉黛浅。\n水国多愁又有情，夜槽压酒银船满。\n綳丝采怨凝晓空，吴王台榭春梦中。\n鸳鸯鸂鶒唤不起，平铺渌水眠东风。\n西陵路边月悄悄，油壁轻车嫁苏小。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}